# Lab UPS — APC Smart-UPS 1500 behind a Network Management Card, on mains power.
# snmprec format: oid|type|value, sorted by OID. Types: 2 Integer, 4 String,
# 6 OID, 65 Counter32, 66 Gauge32, 67 TimeTicks. "type:numeric|..." values are
# computed live by snmpsim's numeric variation module (sysUpTime ticks, the load
# breathes slowly), so graphs move even though the file is static.
#
# The `ups` profile requires BOTH a sysObjectID under 1.3.6.1.4.1.318 (APC) AND a
# sysDescr matching /[Uu][Pp][Ss]/ — "Smart-UPS" satisfies the second.
